Subject: [PATCH 093/125] fix(physics): preserve thin block collisions in voxel
 fast path

Material flags cannot prove collision absence: carpet and lily pads require canonical block dispatch. Classify each state once per World collision probe.

Verify ordered World.getCubes parity with optimization enabled and disabled, thin shapes, exact touching faces, chunk and height boundaries, and lily-pad boat dispatch. Full API and server suites pass on JDK 21 with no build cache. Stone/air 12800-query diagnostic: 46.074 ms baseline, 39.029 ms optimized; later suite run 31.591 vs 30.453 ms shows timing variability. MCP 9.40 BlockCarpet and BlockLilyPad checked.

